<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TechNova | Learning Hub</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    color:#172554;
    background:#dbeafe;
}

.page{
    width:95%;
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:12px auto;
    background:white;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:2px solid #64748b;
    box-shadow:0 5px 18px #94a3b8;
}

header{
    padding:25px;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#172554,#2563eb,#7c3aed);
}

header h1{margin:0;font-size:35px}
header p{margin:7px;color:#dbeafe}

nav{
    padding:9px;
    text-align:center;
    background:#cfe8f3;
}

nav a{
    display:inline-block;
    margin:2px;
    padding:7px 18px;
    color:#172554;
    text-decoration:none;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:white;
    background:#7c3aed;
}

section{
    margin:12px;
    padding:18px;
    background:#f8fafc;
    border-radius:7px;
}

h2{
    margin-top:0;
    color:#1d4ed8;
}

.intro{
    margin:100px 150px 100px 80px;
    color:green;
    letter-spacing:5px;
    text-align:right;
    text-decoration:underline;
    text-shadow:4px 4px 8px blue;
    font-family:Georgia,Garamond,serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-weight:bolder;
    font-size:20px;
}

.courses,.skills{
    display:flex;
    gap:15px;
    justify-content:center;
}

.card{
    width:23%;
    padding:10px;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    background:#163d70;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.card img{
    width:90px;
    height:90px;
    object-fit:contain;
}

.card p{margin:6px}

.course{
    width:50%;
    height:200px;
    margin:18px auto;
    padding:15px;
    background-color:lightblue;
    background-image:url("paper.jpg");
    background-repeat:no-repeat;
    background-position:right;
    border-left:6px solid #2563eb;
}

.block{
    display:block;
    padding:12px;
    margin:15px 0;
    text-align:center;
    background:#ddd6fe;
}

.inline{
    display:inline;
    padding:8px;
    background:#fef3c7;
}

.skill{
    width:48%;
    padding:15px;
    text-align:center;
    background:#e0f2fe;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.skill img{
    width:110px;
    height:110px;
    object-fit:contain;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:3px solid #172554;
}

.skill ul{
    text-align:left;
    list-style-type:circle;
}

.skill li{margin:6px}

.about{
    column-count:2;
    column-gap:30px;
    padding:15px;
    background:#eef2ff;
}

footer{
    padding:15px;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    background:#172554;
}

@media(max-width:600px){

    .page{width:98%}

    .intro{
        margin:30px 20px;
        font-size:16px;
    }

    .courses,.skills{
        flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .card,.skill{
        width:47%;
    }

    .course{
        width:90%;
        height:auto;
    }

    .about{
        column-count:1;
    }

    nav a{
        display:block;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

<header>
    <h1>TechNova</h1>
    <p>Computer & Technology Learning Hub</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
    <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">

<h2>Welcome to TechNova</h2>

<p class="intro">
Learn, Code and Innovate
</p>

<div class="block">
🚀 Start Your Coding Journey Today!
</div>

<div style="text-align:center">
<span class="inline">
New: Full Stack Development
</span>
</div>

</section>

<section id="courses">

<h2>Popular Courses</h2>

<div class="courses">

<div class="card">
<img src="html.jpg">
<p>HTML5</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="css3.jpg">
<p>CSS3</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="javascript.jpg">
<p>JavaScript</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="python.jpg">
<p>Python</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="course">

<h2>Featured Course</h2>

Learn HTML, CSS and JavaScript
through practical examples.

</div>

</section>

<section id="skills">

<h2>Learning Skills</h2>

<div class="skills">

<div class="skill">

<img src="hard.png">

<h3>Hard Skills</h3>

<ul>
<li>HTML & CSS</li>
<li>C and Java</li>
<li>Python and SQL</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="skill">

<img src="soft.png">

<h3>Soft Skills</h3>

<ul>
<li>Communication</li>
<li>Teamwork</li>
<li>Problem Solving</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="about">

<h2>About TechNova</h2>

<div class="about">

TechNova is a learning hub designed
for CSE students. It provides technology
courses and useful coding resources.

Students can improve their skills,
create projects and learn through
simple practical examples.

</div>

</section>

<footer>
© 2026 TechNova | Learn • Code • Innovate
</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
